1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,872
The wall.

2
00:00:00,872 --> 00:00:07,838
A hard, sculptured outer exine made of sporopollenin, the toughest organic material known.

3
00:00:07,838 --> 00:00:11,914
That is why pollen survives for millions of years as fossils.

4
00:00:11,914 --> 00:00:16,315
It has thin spots, the germ pores, where the tube will come out.

5
00:00:16,315 --> 00:00:20,234
Inside it, a thin intine of cellulose and pectin.

